invariant: INV-5
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: the chain call gives its writer one byte more than der_len, so a
  chain one byte over the caller's DER room reads and its last byte lands
  past the room. test_chain_room fills a room of 12,288 bytes and requires
  CH_EINVAL in a room one byte shorter.

--- old
    wb_init(&w, der, der_len);
    pem_blocks blocks;
    pem_blocks_init(&blocks, pem, pem_len, PEM_TEXT_REFUSED);
--- new
    wb_init(&w, der, der_len + 1);
    pem_blocks blocks;
    pem_blocks_init(&blocks, pem, pem_len, PEM_TEXT_REFUSED);
